"Biz so'nggi 30 kunda hh.uz'da e'lon qilingan <b>{a} ta vakansiyani</b> tahlil qildik. Ulardan <b>{b} tasi</b> tajribasiz nomzodlarni ham qabul qiladi.": "We analysed <b>{a} vacancies</b> posted on hh.uz in the last 30 days. <b>{b}</b> of them also accept candidates without experience.",
"Bu yo'nalishda hozir vakansiyalar juda kam. Daromad ko'proq frilans buyurtmalar yoki o'z ishingiz orqali keladi.": "There are very few vacancies in this field right now. Income comes more from freelance orders or your own business.",
"Bu kurs sizga <b>{j}</b> lavozimlariga kuchli rezyume bilan ariza topshirishingizga yordam beradi.": "This course helps you apply for <b>{j}</b> roles with a strong résumé.",
"Bu kurs <b>{j}</b> ishiga kirish uchun asos beradi. Ishga tayyor bo'lish uchun kursdan keyin amaliyot va qo'shimcha ko'nikmalarni ham o'rganing.": "This course gives you a basis for work as: <b>{j}</b>. To be job-ready, practise after the course and learn extra skills.",
"Bu orqali qanday pul topsa bo'ladi?": "How can you earn with this?", "Bu kurs sizga nima beradi?": "What does this course give you?", "Hozir ochiq vakansiyalar: hh.uz": "Open vacancies now: hh.uz",
"Tajribasiz qabul qiladigan vakansiyalar: hh.uz": "Vacancies without experience: hh.uz", "Hozir maoshi oyiga 3,5 mln so'm va undan yuqori ko'rsatilgan vakansiya topilmadi. Barcha e'lonlarni hh.uz'da ko'ring.": "No vacancies with a salary of 3.5 mln soum a month or more right now. See all adverts on hh.uz.",
"OLX.uz e'lonlari": "OLX.uz adverts", "hh.uz'da ko'proq": "More on hh.uz", "OLX.uz'da ko'proq": "More on OLX.uz", "Ishni qanday topasiz?": "How to find a job?",
"<b>Qayerdan qidirish:</b> hh.uz, OLX.uz ning \"Ish\" bo'limi, LinkedIn va Telegram'dagi ish kanallari.": "<b>Where to look:</b> hh.uz, the \"Jobs\" section of OLX.uz, LinkedIn and job channels on Telegram.",
"<b>Qanday qidirish:</b> lavozim nomini o'zbek va rus tilida yozib qidiring": "<b>How to search:</b> search for the job title in Uzbek and Russian", ", masalan: \"{h}\"": ", for example: \"{h}\"",
"<b>Rezyume:</b> kurs sertifikatini, kurs davomida qilgan amaliy ishlaringizni va natijalaringizni qo'shing.": "<b>Résumé:</b> add the course certificate, your practical work and results from the course.",
"<b>Tajribasiz:</b> bunday vakansiyalarning {n}% qismi tajribasiz nomzodlarni ham qabul qiladi. Stajirovka va yordamchi lavozimlardan boshlang.": "<b>No experience:</b> {n}% of these vacancies accept candidates without experience. Start with internships and assistant roles.",
"<b>Joylashuv:</b> vakansiyalarning {a}% Toshkentda, {b}% masofaviy.": "<b>Location:</b> {a}% of vacancies are in Tashkent, {b}% remote.",
"<b>Faollik:</b> har kuni 5-10 ta arizani yuboring va har bir vakansiyaga qisqa xat yozing.": "<b>Be active:</b> send 5-10 applications a day with a short letter for each.",
