"tajribasiz nomzodlarni qabul qiladigan istalgan ish": "any job that takes candidates without experience",
"Bu kurslarning asosiy maqsadi: o'z biznesingizni ochish va boshqarish. Yollanib ishlash uchun esa rahbarlik va loyiha boshqaruvi lavozimlariga yo'l ochadi.": "The main goal of these courses: starting and running your own business. For employment, they open the way to management and project roles.",
"Bu kurs haydovchilik guvohnomasini olishga tayyorlaydi. Haydovchi bo'lib ishlash uchun guvohnoma va odatda haydash tajribasi so'raladi.": "This course prepares you for the driving licence. Driver jobs ask for a licence and usually driving experience.",
"Arxitektor bo'lib ishlash uchun odatda oliy ma'lumot va diplom talab qilinadi. Interyer dizayni va 3D vizualizatsiya bilan tezroq boshlash mumkin.": "Working as an architect usually requires a university degree. You can start faster with interior design and 3D visualisation.",
"AI vositalari odatda asosiy kasbga qo'shimcha ko'nikma sifatida so'raladi: dizayner, SMM mutaxassisi, marketolog va boshqalar. Shuning uchun bu kurs boshqa kasb bilan birga eng ko'p foyda beradi.": "AI tools are usually asked for as an extra skill on top of a main job: designer, SMM specialist, marketer and others. So this course helps most together with another profession.",
"Marketpleyslarda ko'pchilik o'z do'konini ochib savdo qiladi. Yollanib ishlash uchun esa marketpleys menejeri lavozimlari bor.": "On marketplaces many people open their own shop. For employment there are marketplace manager roles.",
"Vakansiyalarning ko'pi 3D modellashtirishni so'raydi. Bu kurs esa 3D printerda chop etishni o'rgatadi, shuning uchun keyin 3D modellashtirishni ham o'rganing.": "Most vacancies ask for 3D modelling, while this course teaches 3D printing, so learn 3D modelling afterwards too.",
"Gidlar ko'pincha mavsumiy ishlaydi va buyurtmalarni turistik firmalar, mehmonxonalar va internet orqali o'zlari topadi.": "Guides often work seasonally and find bookings themselves through travel firms, hotels and the internet.",
"Trading asosan o'z pulingiz bilan mustaqil faoliyat. Yollanib ishlash uchun vakansiyalar juda kam va moliya bo'yicha ma'lumot so'raladi.": "Trading is mostly independent work with your own money. Jobs are very rare and ask for a finance education.",
"Limonchilik bilan ko'pchilik o'z issiqxonasida limon va ko'chat yetishtirib sotadi.": "Many people grow and sell lemons and seedlings in their own greenhouse.",
"Ingliz tili o'qituvchilaridan odatda IELTS 7 va undan yuqori ball so'raladi.": "English teacher jobs usually ask for IELTS 7 or higher.",
"Bu kurs bitta kasbga emas, ish topish ko'nikmasiga o'rgatadi: rezyume yozish, suhbatdan o'tish va o'zingizga mos ishni tanlash.": "This course teaches job hunting rather than one profession: writing a résumé, passing interviews and choosing the right job.",
"Bu kurs internetdagi ma'lumotni tekshirish va tanqidiy fikrlashga o'rgatadi. Bu har qanday kasbda foydali ko'nikma, lekin alohida kasb emas.": "This course teaches checking information online and critical thinking. A useful skill in any job, but not a profession on its own.",
"Bu qo'llanma Ustoz AI platformasida o'z kursingizni yaratib joylashtirishni o'rgatadi. Daromad: kursingizni o'quvchilarga sotish orqali.": "This guide teaches you to create and publish your own course on Ustoz AI. Income: selling your course to students.",
"Bu qo'l mehnati va ijod kursi. Bu ko'nikma bilan odatda ishga yollanmaydi, lekin tayyor buyumlarni Instagram, Telegram va OLX orqali sotib daromad qilish mumkin.": "This is a handicraft course. People are rarely hired for this skill, but you can earn by selling your items on Instagram, Telegram and OLX.",
"Bu kurs ijod va qiziqish uchun. U alohida kasbga tayyorlamaydi, lekin yangi ko'nikma va ilhom beradi.": "This course is for creativity and fun. It does not prepare you for a profession, but gives new skills and inspiration.",
"Bu kurs sport mahoratingizni oshirish uchun. Murabbiy bo'lib ishlash uchun odatda sport ma'lumoti va tajriba so'raladi.": "This course improves your sports skills. Coaching jobs usually ask for sports education and experience.",
"Bu kurs bilimingizni oshiradi. Tibbiyot sohasida ishlash uchun tibbiy oliy yoki o'rta maxsus ma'lumot va diplom talab qilinadi.": "This course builds your knowledge. Medical jobs require a medical degree or college diploma.",
"Bu kurs maktab fanlarini mustahkamlash va imtihonlarga tayyorlanish uchun mo'ljallangan.": "This course is for strengthening school subjects and preparing for exams.",
