"Har bir fandan to'g'ri javoblaringiz sonini belgilang. Sertifikatingiz bo'lsa, uni tanlang: ball rasmiy qoidalar bo'yicha hisoblanadi.": "Set your number of correct answers for each subject. If you have a certificate, choose it: the score follows the official rules.",
