"Majburiy fanlar: ona tili, matematika va O'zbekiston tarixi, har biridan 10 ta savol, har bir to'g'ri javob 1,1 ball (jami 33 ball).": "Compulsory subjects: native language, mathematics and history of Uzbekistan, 10 questions each, 1.1 points per correct answer (33 points in total).",
"1-mutaxassislik fani: 30 ta savol, har biri 3,1 ball (93 ball). 2-mutaxassislik fani: 30 ta savol, har biri 2,1 ball (63 ball).": "Specialty subject 1: 30 questions, 3.1 points each (93 points). Specialty subject 2: 30 questions, 2.1 points each (63 points).",
"Majburiy fan bo'yicha istalgan darajadagi milliy sertifikat shu fandan maksimal ball beradi.": "A national certificate of any grade in a compulsory subject gives full points in it.",
"Mutaxassislik fanidan A+ va A darajali sertifikat maksimal ball beradi; B+, B, C+ va C darajalarida ball A darajaga (65 ball) nisbatan mutanosib hisoblanadi.": "An A+ or A certificate in a specialty subject gives full points; for B+, B, C+ and C the points are in proportion to the A level (65).",
"Chet tilidan B2, C1 yoki IELTS 5.5 va undan yuqori sertifikat maksimal ball beradi, B1 darajasi maksimal ballning 75 foizini beradi.": "A foreign language certificate at B2, C1 or IELTS 5.5+ gives full points; B1 gives 75% of the maximum.",
"Manba: Bilim va malakalarni baholash agentligi (uzbmb.uz). Har yilgi qabul qoidalarini rasmiy saytdan tekshiring.": "Source: Agency for Assessment of Knowledge and Skills (uzbmb.uz). Check each year's admission rules on the official site.",
