"Bu qisqa so'rovnoma sizga qiziqishingiz va maqsadingizga mos kurslarni topishga yordam beradi. To'g'ri yoki noto'g'ri javob yo'q. Biror ishni hali sinab ko'rmagan bo'lsangiz, \"Hali sinab ko'rmaganman\" variantini tanlang. Natija sizga tavsiya beradi, yakuniy tanlov esa o'zingizniki.": "This short survey helps you find courses that suit your interests and goals. There are no right or wrong answers. If you haven't tried something yet, choose \"I haven't tried it yet\". The result gives you a recommendation, and the final choice is yours.",
